  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing a Center of Excellence on Packaging in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNIDO and the World Packaging Organisation (WPO) have a long-term strategic partnership. Within the scope of cooperation, establishment of Centers of Excellence on Packaging (CEP) is a key activity, with success stories from Lebanon and Jordan.  The request from the Ministry of Trade, Industry, and Co-operatives of Uganda seeks UNIDO support in establishing a CEP in the country.  The preparatory assistance aims to conduct a feasibility study and develop a project document for the establishment of a CEP in Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular Programme Of Technical Cooperati</narrative>
